# Frontend Development Playbook

When implementing frontend work:

- Clarify product type and stack first.
- Keep strong comments, structure, reuse, and modularity.
- Avoid oversized page files and repeated logic.
- When pages involve admin UI, follow the repository's admin UI quality standards too.
- Shared UI packages provide presentation components; apps retain API, routing, stores, permissions, and domain models. Surface real API errors.

## Cross-Project Standards

新项目启动、设计系统制定或跨页面规范统一时，先读取 `project-standards-playbook/SKILL.md` 及其适用细则；小修复按影响范围应用，保留已有确认参数。
